                <invention-title lang="en">Application of swine IL-28B as immunopotentiator in preparation of swine fever E2 subunit vaccine</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="ol">一种猪源IL-28B作为免疫增强剂在制备猪瘟E2亚单位疫苗中的应用</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention discloses an application of swine IL-28B as an immunopotentiator in preparation of a swine fever E2 subunit vaccine. The CSF subunit vaccine is one of CSF vaccines and is mainly prepared by taking E2 protein as an antigen. In order to enhance the immunogenicity of the E2 protein, IL-28B is used as an immunopotentiator to prepare a novel swine fever E2 subunit vaccine, CSFV E2 protein and IL-28B protein are successfully expressed by using CHO-S cells, and the expressed protein is used for preparing the swine fever E2 subunit vaccine. Compared with the E2 protein, the E2 + IL-28B mixed protein can induce a higher level of CSFV antibody blocking rate and virus neutralizing antibody titer after immunizing a mouse. Immune test results show that IL-28B can enhance humoral immunity and cellular immunity effects of the E2 protein expressed by CHO-S cells, and technical support is provided for prevention and control of CSF.</p>
            </abstract>
            <abstract lang="ol">
                <p>本发明公开了一种猪源IL‑28B作为免疫增强剂在制备猪瘟E2亚单位疫苗中的应用。CSF亚单位疫苗是CSF疫苗中的一种，主要以E2蛋白为抗原制备而成。为了增强E2蛋白的免疫原性，本发明使用IL‑28B做为免疫增强剂，制备了一种新型猪瘟E2亚单位疫苗，利用CHO‑S细胞成功表达了CSFV E2蛋白和IL‑28B蛋白，表达的蛋白制备猪瘟E2亚单位疫苗。与E2蛋白相比，E2+IL‑28B混合蛋白免疫小鼠后能够诱导更高水平的CSFV抗体阻断率和病毒中和抗体效价。免疫试验结果表明IL‑28B能够增强CHO‑S细胞表达的E2蛋白的体液免疫和细胞免疫效果，本发明将为CSF的防控提供技术支撑。</p>
            </abstract>
