                <invention-title lang="en">Superoxide dismutase mutant as well as expression method and application thereof</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="ol">超氧化物歧化酶突变体及其表达方法和应用</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention relates to a superoxide dismutase mutant as well as an expression method and application thereof. The superoxide dismutase mutant is a mutant of marine thermophilic bacteria superoxide dismutase, the amino acid sequence of the marine thermophilic bacteria superoxide dismutase is as shown in SEQ ID NO.1, and the superoxide dismutase mutant is obtained by substituting, deleting or adding one or more amino acids to the marine thermophilic bacteria superoxide dismutase. The amino acid sequence of the superoxide dismutase mutant is as shown in SEQ ID NO.3, and the nucleotide sequence for coding the superoxide dismutase mutant is as shown in SEQ ID NO.4. The invention also provides application of the superoxide dismutase mutant in preparation of antioxidant products and application of the superoxide dismutase mutant in preparation of drugs for treating fatty liver. The superoxide dismutase mutant provided by the invention is high in heat resistance, is beneficial to being processed into different products, and can be stored at normal temperature, so that the cost can be greatly reduced.</p>
            </abstract>
            <abstract lang="ol">
                <p>本发明涉及一种超氧化物歧化酶突变体及其表达方法和应用。超氧化物歧化酶突变体为海洋栖热菌超氧化物歧化酶的突变体，所述海洋栖热菌超氧化物歧化酶的氨基酸序列如SEQ ID NO.1所示，所述超氧化物歧化酶突变体为所述海洋栖热菌超氧化物歧化酶经过取代、缺失或添加一个或多个氨基酸得到。所述氧化物歧化酶突变体的氨基酸序列如SEQ ID NO.3所示，编码所述超氧化物歧化酶突变体的核苷酸序列如SEQ ID NO.4所示。本发明还提供了超氧化物歧化酶突变体在制备抗氧化产品中的应用和在制备治疗脂肪肝的药物中的应用。本发明提供的所述超氧化物歧化酶突变体耐热性强，利于加工制成不同的产品，常温保存，可大幅降低成本。</p>
            </abstract>
